&#x02013;3.65 (3.78&#x02013;3.65)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">29.51&#x02013;2.90 (3.00&#x02013;2.90)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">No. of observations</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">337049</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">668591</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">No. of unique observations</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">16328</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">57961</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Average redundancy</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">20.64 (21.12)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">11.54 (11.56)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Completeness (%)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">100.0 (100.0)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">100.0 (100.0)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02329;<italic>I</italic>/&#x003c3;(<italic>I</italic>)&#x0232a;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">13.1 (7.1)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">15.2 (5.4)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top"><italic>R</italic><sub>merge</sub><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn1">&#x02020;</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">0.113 (0.413)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">0.083 (0.417)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1"><label>&#x02020;</label><p>                     <italic>R</italic>                     <sub>merge</sub> = <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="f-62-00676-efi1.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>                     <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="f-62-00676-efi2.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>